{"title": "Crossbow Expert: Point-Blank", "pageid": 17001, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Crossbow_Expert:_Point-Blank", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank.webp/300px-Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank.webp, /w/images/5/56/Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank.webp/300px-Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Crossbow Expert: Point-Blank</b> is a passive feature that allows you to make crossbow attacks within melee range without having <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you make crossbow attacks within melee range, the <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> do not have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Crossbow_Expert\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Crossbow Expert\">Crossbow Expert</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Add%27ath\" title=\"Add'ath\">Add'ath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Aggralix\" title=\"Aggralix\">Aggralix</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ahu%27u%27rag\" title=\"Ahu'u'rag\">Ahu'u'rag</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Arrinye\" title=\"Arrinye\">Arrinye</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bella_(Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress)\" title=\"Bella (Wyrm's Rock Fortress)\">Bella (Wyrm's Rock Fortress)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chost\" title=\"Chost\">Chost</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chy%27raagh\" title=\"Chy'raagh\">Chy'raagh</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Clover\" title=\"Clover\">Clover</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dart_Dirtwood\" title=\"Dart Dirtwood\">Dart Dirtwood</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Debin\" title=\"Debin\">Debin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Equidna\" title=\"Equidna\">Equidna</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/G%27r%27ath\" title=\"G'r'ath\">G'r'ath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gai\" title=\"Gai\">Gai</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Glenvora\" title=\"Glenvora\">Glenvora</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gneiss\" title=\"Gneiss\">Gneiss</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gonfalon\" title=\"Gonfalon\">Gonfalon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Griff\" title=\"Griff\">Griff</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gummidge\" title=\"Gummidge\">Gummidge</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hagedorrn\" title=\"Hagedorrn\">Hagedorrn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Havard\" title=\"Havard\">Havard</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Helag\" title=\"Helag\">Helag</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jy%27ir\" title=\"Jy'ir\">Jy'ir</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kethk\" title=\"Kethk\">Kethk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kharyk\" title=\"Kharyk\">Kharyk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ko%27kuu\" title=\"Ko'kuu\">Ko'kuu</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kyberos\" title=\"Kyberos\">Kyberos</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kyrr%27a%27ath\" title=\"Kyrr'a'ath\">Kyrr'a'ath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Larche\" title=\"Larche\">Larche</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lionel_(Rivington)\" title=\"Lionel (Rivington)\">Lionel (Rivington)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Shattershield%27s_Attendant\" title=\"Lord Shattershield's Attendant\">Lord Shattershield's Attendant</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Loudstone\" title=\"Loudstone\">Loudstone</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ly%27iss\" title=\"Ly'iss\">Ly'iss</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Madigan\" title=\"Madigan\">Madigan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Magnolia\" title=\"Magnolia\">Magnolia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mibbs\" title=\"Mibbs\">Mibbs</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%AEran\" title=\"Mîran\">Mîran</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nimba%27as\" title=\"Nimba'as\">Nimba'as</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nobster\" title=\"Nobster\">Nobster</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Olloa\" title=\"Olloa\">Olloa</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pard\" title=\"Pard\">Pard</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pol\" title=\"Pol\">Pol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ra%27gur\" title=\"Ra'gur\">Ra'gur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rockbothem\" title=\"Rockbothem\">Rockbothem</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Seyama\" title=\"Seyama\">Seyama</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Un%27n\" title=\"Un'n\">Un'n</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Voss%27_Raider\" title=\"Voss' Raider\">Voss' Raider</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wearne\" title=\"Wearne\">Wearne</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zar%27an\" title=\"Zar'an\">Zar'an</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zastri\" title=\"Zastri\">Zastri</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zeddi%27in\" title=\"Zeddi'in\">Zeddi'in</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zerentha\" title=\"Zerentha\">Zerentha</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zunii\" title=\"Zunii\">Zunii</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Due to the mechanics of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Threatened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\">Threatened</a>, having two or more enemies in melee range renders this feat useless. It only helps when there is a single enemy in melee range and the attack is made against that enemy.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Crossbow attacks from melee range don't receive <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200737\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 899/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6890/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4188/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nEx